Return ONLY a single JSON object, no other text, no markdown fences, with exactly this shape:

{"fixes": [
  {"chapter_index": 5, "issue": "short description of the specific problem, including the exact conflicting values found", "instruction": "a specific instruction for how to fix it when that chapter is regenerated"}
], "title": "the current title, or a corrected one if the current title contradicts the text's facts"}

If there are no continuity problems, return an empty "fixes" list. List at most five fixes, the five most important ones, ordered by severity. Numeric contradictions (including title-vs-text contradictions) are exactly as important as name or timeline breaks — do not under-report them.
